Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.62,0:00:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Previously on JoJo's Bizarre Adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.14,0:00:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I'm going to\Nbe able to help you, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.84,0:00:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been my job to repair rooftops\Nin Cairo for around 40 years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.12,0:00:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I can't say that I've\Never seen a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.40,0:00:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And my daughter's condition is much worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.02,0:00:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At best, she has three or four days left.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.74,0:00:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can almost feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.60,0:00:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like Dio's right on top of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.16,0:00:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.58,0:00:29.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll talk to everyone\Nhere until we find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.14,0:00:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a real scorcher out here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.34,0:00:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't had a shower in almost two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.44,0:00:44.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's beginning to ruin my je ne Suzi Quee.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.64,0:00:50.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.66,0:00:54.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh... Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.94,0:01:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.92,0:01:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the big idea, asshole?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.90,0:01:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got some kind of problem with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.42,0:01:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a problem with\Nwhere you're sitting!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.22,0:01:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A cocky foreigner like you has no business
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.40,0:01:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sitting here pretending\Nto be some kind of beggar!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.68,0:01:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you have a lick of common sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.08,0:01:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who said that you could sit here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.74,0:01:33.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, you must be a beggar\Nfrom a foreign land.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.62,0:01:36.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know this isn't much\NBut I hope it helps.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.08,0:01:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, but
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.44,0:01:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You back off pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.22,0:01:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my turf.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.26,0:01:44.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You poofy-haired blockhead
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.84,0:01:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to hey hold a wrap?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.72,0:01:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't just sit there with your mouth agape\Ngive that money to him immediately Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.54,0:01:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get what's going\Non here. He's a beggar.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.64,0:02:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll have to forgive my\Nfriend's obliviousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.96,0:02:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not accustomed to\Nthe rules of this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.58,0:02:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me you were\Na beggar in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.48,0:02:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's called having a shtick, you numbnut.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.58,0:02:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People around here know\Nme as a mute beggar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.68,0:02:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something known as\Na beggar's association here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.84,0:02:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beggars have their own\Nareas where they're paid
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.80,0:02:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to do nothing but sit\Naround and beg all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.20,0:02:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While it may seem strange to us,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.02,0:02:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the rules they put in place help\Nkeep everything running smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.36,0:02:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.98,0:02:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, and that exchange from\Nearlier has hurt my pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.04,0:02:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I'd make more money by\Ndisguising myself as a foreign beggar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.36,0:02:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hobos, they are a changin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.68,0:02:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way, I thought I\Nrecognized you from somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.10,0:02:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm not mistaken, you're\NAvdol the fortune teller.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.20,0:02:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way I hear it, you got\Nspooked and fled to Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.00,0:02:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, someone was\Nlooking to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.36,0:02:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd rather discuss us needing\Na favor from the one who knows
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.52,0:02:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everything there is to know about\Nthis area you'll be well compensated.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.14,0:03:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's imperative that we find this\Nbuilding as quickly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.74,0:03:05.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're running out of time.
