Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.54,0:03:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've done enough work for one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.02,0:03:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gents have my word that I'll\Nfind the mansion in three hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.00,0:03:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just sit tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.18,0:03:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, did anyone\Nsee where Iggy ran off to?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.50,0:03:46.34,SC Opening 2 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,953)}Seeking out...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.00,0:04:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am never going to work with fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.12,0:04:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.36,0:04:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Start, I am not gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.96,0:04:31.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the life is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.62,0:04:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Changed the moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.92,0:04:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be done, I will not continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.40,0:04:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will continue to walk in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.82,0:04:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I faced the last page.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.16,0:04:57.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hear!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.59,0:05:14.67,Title 3,title,0,0,0,,{\fad(273,471)\pos(150,877)}Episode 38: The Guardian of Hell, Pet Shop, Part 1
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.48,0:05:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.54,0:05:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Naaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.10,0:06:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
