Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.64,0:07:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iggy thought to himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.42,0:07:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, that bird is a stand user, same as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.08,0:07:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Given that it offed that guy\Nwith a giant block of ice,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.00,0:07:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it must be the guard around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.06,0:07:37.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll kill anyone who\Napproaches the mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.42,0:07:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means that bird's next\Ntarget is probably gonna be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.38,0:07:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From early on,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.50,0:07:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the ancient Egyptians\Nrecognized the prowess of
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.98,0:07:57.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the noble falcon soaring\Nhigh above the Nile Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.10,0:07:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They trained the bird\Nas a hunting partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.16,0:08:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And considered it a symbol of Horus?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.46,0:08:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guardian deity of the royal family.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.96,0:08:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The falcon's vision is able to spot\Nprey from several kilometers away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.16,0:08:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its oculus is forever\Nrepresented by the Eye of Horus,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.44,0:08:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an emblem of protection and royal power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.78,0:08:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The falcon soaring through\Nthe air is called Pet Shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.20,0:08:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is the wielder of the\NStand Horus, God of the Sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.26,0:08:28.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nervously, Iggy thought, Damn\Nit, this is just my luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.40,0:08:30.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like I stumbled on Dio's mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.84,0:08:34.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd I have to find this place\Ninstead of one of the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.70,0:08:38.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's worse, that falcon can use its\Nstand to shoot giant chunks of ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.32,0:08:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like a super powered guard dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.74,0:08:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, it's more like a guard bird.
