Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.92,0:09:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I want is a little Aranar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.72,0:09:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A girl of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.86,0:09:11.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some place to settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.54,0:09:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fighting someone else's battle\Nisn't on my list of things to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.26,0:09:16.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.17,0:09:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even if I were to throw down with Tweety\Nover there, what would I get in return?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.20,0:09:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm putting\Nmy life on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.80,0:09:25.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to bring out that\Nold dumb dog routine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.50,0:09:28.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bird brain will never\Nsuspect them with those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.40,0:10:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those eyes, that's the thing about birds,\Nyou can never tell what they're thinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.82,0:10:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet my stand could take him,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.72,0:10:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but then again, there's a reason I'm\Nmaking a fool out of myself here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.92,0:10:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got nothing to do with\NJotaro and those other guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.10,0:10:11.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go back to your mansion,\Nyou feathered freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.32,0:10:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? A bird?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.86,0:10:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with this bird?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.46,0:10:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why isn't the damn thing moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.76,0:10:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.90,0:10:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna run it over!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.92,0:10:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything\Nlike that bird in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.98,0:10:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could it fly under a\Ncar so low to the ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.46,0:10:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It didn't even try to\Ndodge out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.92,0:10:50.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It dove without giving\Nit a second thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.84,0:10:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crazy bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.36,0:10:57.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it seems like the freaks\Nlost interest to me, for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.40,0:11:00.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, apparently,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.31,0:11:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it only goes on the offensive when people\Ntry to make their way inside the mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.70,0:11:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.90,0:11:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if Jotaro and the others ever\Nend up finding this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.00,0:11:11.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they'll have a hell of\Na time trying to get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.50,0:11:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh well, that's their\Nproblem to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.06,0:11:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Butch! Tiny! Butch! Tiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.40,0:11:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd you guys go?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.90,0:11:25.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you haven't seen my\Ndogs around, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.92,0:11:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their names are Butch and\NTiny, if that helps at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.50,0:11:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get the hell out of my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.80,0:11:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a dog, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.50,0:11:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if I knew, it's\Nnot like I could answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.74,0:11:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you, stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.34,0:11:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.66,0:11:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That collar looks like...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.74,0:11:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.80,0:11:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Tiny's.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.26,0:11:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.28,0:11:47.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is it under this gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.26,0:11:49.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why is there blood on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.24,0:11:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tiny and Butch?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.60,0:11:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he talking about those big dogs?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.44,0:11:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.62,0:11:56.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Butch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.82,0:11:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that kid thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.26,0:12:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he tries going under the gate, he'll\Nhave to face the wrath of that bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.66,0:12:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll murder him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.78,0:12:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tiny! Butch! Are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.54,0:12:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tiny! Butch!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.36,0:12:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tiny! Butch!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.70,0:12:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know why I'm getting so worked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.08,0:12:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If some human kid bites a\Nbig one, it's not my problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.22,0:12:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Survival of the fittest, as they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.00,0:12:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stupid die first, as do\Npeople who act recklessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.56,0:12:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd rather stay out of\Nthis, so... Goodbye, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.56,0:12:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tiny! Butch, come out! This isn't funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.26,0:12:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here to take you home!
