Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.58,0:14:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He had finally revealed his stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.24,0:14:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,confirming Pet Shop's suspicions about\NIggy's extraordinary canine abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.02,0:14:09.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring it, Feather Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.54,0:14:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to rip you to shreds!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.30,0:14:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Falcon is known\Nfor its ability to dive
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.96,0:14:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at speeds of over 300 kilometers per hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.90,0:14:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,making it the fastest\Nanimal on the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.50,0:14:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even at its trademark speed, the falcon\Ncan spot its quarry with pinpoint accuracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.86,0:14:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The prey, once discovered, faces a violent\Ndeath by way of razor-sharp talons.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.06,0:14:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.58,0:14:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he just smirk at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.78,0:14:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have sworn I saw the\Ncorners of its beak creep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.60,0:14:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But birds can't smile, can they?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.00,0:14:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.96,0:14:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The air, it's getting colder.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.80,0:15:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ice is coming out of the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.74,0:15:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm such an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.04,0:15:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so focused on the bird, I didn't\Nrealize my feet were frozen over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.84,0:15:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stance feet froze too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.14,0:15:12.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.06,0:15:15.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Icicles!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.44,0:15:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, give it to me straight, Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.44,0:15:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you honestly believe that guy has\Nany chance of finding Dio's mansion?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.68,0:15:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I certainly hope so,\Nbecause if he can't find it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.44,0:15:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no one left in this city who can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.56,0:16:00.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one knows Cairo's complex\Nmaze of streets better than him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.50,0:16:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try and have some faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.90,0:16:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Faith is something I'm\Nquickly running out of.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.24,0:16:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been looking around this godforsaken\Ncity for three days with no luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.08,0:16:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I highly doubt some beggar will\Nfind the mansion in three hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.46,0:16:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're starting to sound like\Na broken record, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.14,0:16:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could at least try\Nto keep a level head.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.06,0:16:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.00,0:16:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all on edge right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.54,0:16:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until our friend gets back, all we\Ncan do is try talking to the locals.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.52,0:16:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.72,0:16:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to make matters worse,\Nwe haven't seen Iggy all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.98,0:16:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the hell did that\Nstupid mutt run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.36,0:16:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He better not be lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.98,0:16:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For as long as I've known him, Iggy's\Nalways been somewhat of a loner.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.38,0:16:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'm sure he's just\Nwandering around somewhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.88,0:16:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,killing time before coming back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.58,0:16:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used to think all dogs lit up and\Nwagged their tails when they saw humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.42,0:16:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd we get stuck with that little cynic?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.66,0:16:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I managed to get away from it somehow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.40,0:16:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Stan's ice attack took\Nthe skin right off my paws!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.36,0:17:01.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.44,0:17:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew I should've let that\Nhuman kid fix his own problems!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.60,0:17:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Stan's power is nothing to sneeze at!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.96,0:17:08.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was no ordinary ice!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.36,0:17:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I bet he still has a few tricks!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.98,0:17:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd better get out of here\Nwhile the getting's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.76,0:17:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about holding a grudge!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.84,0:18:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iggy disappeared, but\Nwhere could he have gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.48,0:18:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.78,0:18:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.82,0:18:13.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bastard doesn't hold anything back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.84,0:18:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.26,0:18:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a dumb bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.22,0:18:20.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place reeks, but\Nit'll have to do for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.94,0:18:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to keep quiet and hide\Nout down here until he gives up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.18,0:18:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this freaky bird's deal?
