Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.26,0:18:50.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.86,0:18:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.28,0:18:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thought you had me, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.06,0:19:00.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what you killed was my\Nshape-shifting stand, the fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.78,0:19:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.00,0:19:08.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you like them apples, Featherbrain?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.02,0:19:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Might want to keep still.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.46,0:19:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're losing\Na lot of blood there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.80,0:19:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But before this drags out any further,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.04,0:19:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you should probably know I don't give\Na rat's ass about you or your master.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.86,0:19:25.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.77,0:19:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say we call this a draw?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.78,0:19:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got a few good hits in\Nwith those ice missiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.88,0:19:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we're even. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.68,0:19:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.76,0:19:41.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who does this guy think he is, Bruce Lee?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.92,0:19:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Can't you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.18,0:19:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said I'll stay away\Nfrom your boss's mansion!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.78,0:19:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's stop this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.88,0:20:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what your skin looks like?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.96,0:20:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I going to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.36,0:20:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stopped your wound from\Nbleeding by freezing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.34,0:20:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell? Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.58,0:20:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blast it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.68,0:20:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, the exit's blocked with ice!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.32,0:20:29.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And more is coming this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.80,0:20:32.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.56,0:20:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to cover the whole tunnel!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.94,0:20:39.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta find a way out of this death trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.92,0:20:52.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.83,0:20:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way you plucked off this exit, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.16,0:21:07.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.07,0:21:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's got me in its crosshairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.56,0:21:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This bird's insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.44,0:21:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is more than sheer determination.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.58,0:21:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This creep's a frickin' killing machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.98,0:21:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if it catches me,\Nit won't just kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.38,0:21:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll leave me alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.72,0:21:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.60,0:21:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.76,0:21:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's my ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.32,0:21:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't fret my pull-a-loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.72,0:22:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.74,0:23:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.47,0:23:28.48,Next Episode,,0,0,0,,{\fs120\pos(960,730)}Next Episode{PREVIEW IS NOT UPDATED}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.26,0:23:28.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can my luck get any worse?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.98,0:23:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That lousy fleabag.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.52,0:23:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bird is pissing me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.42,0:23:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It didn't occur to me until a moment ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.46,0:23:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but a stand user is likely\Nto be guarding Dio's lair.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.04,0:23:41.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either way you slice it, I don't have\Nmuch choice, so it's do or die time!
